l":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-4a48d26a1b86055f66a2"]},"ordering_evidence":"gongsuntao-q-4a48d26a1b86055f66a2","source_order":[8,146,33],"order":2010}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0083","name":"于夫罗","evidence":["wudi-q-o019","dongyuan-q-p006","gongsuntao-q-aeb88901afccd8c20e83","gongsuntao-q-4a48d26a1b86055f66a2"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o019-wudi-p0083","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o019"]},{"id":"wudi-m-p036-wudi-p0083","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p036"]},{"id":"wudi-m-o024-wudi-p0083","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o024"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p006-wudi-p0083","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p006"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p063-wudi-p0083","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p063"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-q-p006","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-fdda259b43db663c5901","layer":"pei","quote":"《典略》载卓表曰：“臣伏惟天下所以有逆不止者，各由黄门、常侍张让等侮慢天常，操擅王命。父子兄弟，并据州郡；一书出门，便获千金。京畿诸郡，数百万膏腴美田，皆属让等。至使怨气上蒸，妖贼蜂起。臣前奉诏讨于扶罗，将士饥乏，不肯渡河。皆言欲诣京师先诛阉竖，以除民害，从台阁求乞资直；臣随慰抚，以至新安。臣闻扬汤止沸，不如灭火去薪；溃痈虽痛，胜于养肉；及溺呼船，悔之无及！”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3ae437330a1ff92c0f47","start":0,"end":181},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p063","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-501b9aaae088f305661d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《九州春秋》曰：“馥遣都督从事赵浮、程奂，将强弩万张，屯河阳。浮等闻馥欲以冀州与绍，自孟津驰东下。时绍尚在朝歌清水口。浮等从后来，船数百艘，众万余人。整兵鼓，夜过绍营，绍甚恶之。浮等到，谓馥曰：‘袁本初军无斗粮，各已离散；虽有张杨、于扶罗新附，未肯为用：不足敌也。小从事等请自以现兵拒之，旬日之间，必土崩瓦解。明将军但当开阽閤高枕，何忧何惧！’馥不从，乃避位，出居赵忠故舍。遣子赍冀州印绶，于黎阳与绍。”","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7c576da3d950edb687e2","start":0,"end":205},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-4a48d26a1b86055f66a2","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-ff04eca961a238e032ba","layer":"original","quote":"单于欲叛绍，杨不从。单于执杨，与俱去；绍使将麹义追击于邺南，破之。单于（执）〔与〕杨至黎阳，攻破度辽将军耿祉军，众复振","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":33,"end":92},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-aeb88901afccd8c20e83","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-ff04eca961a238e032ba","layer":"original","quote":"山东兵起，欲诛卓。袁绍至河内，杨与绍合，复与匈奴单于于夫罗屯漳水","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"wudi-e-o019b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":82},{"id":"wudi-e-o024a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2e697c9981c6cd8d3e8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，军鄄城〖2〗。荆州牧刘表断术粮道〖3〗。术引军入陈留，屯封丘〖4〗；黑山余贼及于夫罗等佐之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53},{"id":"wudi-e-p036a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2ceddec5e41a1265b46c","layer":"pei","quote":"于夫罗者，南单于子也。中平中，发匈奴兵，于夫罗率以助汉。会本国反，杀南单于，于夫罗遂将其众留中国。","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c26e3de39ce6fb61d112","start":10,"end":59},{"id":"wudi-e-p036b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2ceddec5e41a1265b46c","layer":"pei","quote":"因天下挠乱，与西河白波贼合；破太原、河内，抄略诸郡为寇。","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c26e3de39ce6fb61d112","start":59,"end":87},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：初平四年（公元 193）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c3dba248d94a4751844d","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85},{"id":"wudi-q-o024","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2e697c9981c6cd8d3e8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，军鄄城〖2〗。荆州牧刘表断术粮道〖3〗。术引军入陈留，屯封丘〖4〗；黑山余贼及于夫罗等佐之。术使将刘详屯匡亭〖5〗。太祖击详，术救之；与战，大破之。术退保封丘，遂围之；未合，术走襄邑〖6〗。追到太寿〖7〗，决渠水灌城；走宁陵〖8〗。又追之，走九江〖9〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134},{"id":"wudi-q-p036","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2ceddec5e41a1265b46c","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“于夫罗者，南单于子也。中平中，发匈奴兵，于夫罗率以助汉。会本国反，杀南单于，于夫罗遂将其众留中国。因天下挠乱，与西河白波贼合；破太原、河内，抄略诸郡为寇。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c26e3de39ce6fb61d112","start":0,"end":88}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
